            "detailed_description": "<strong>IMPORTANT: </strong><br><br><i>This game has been out of active development for many years but I plan to get an updated version, content complete, out soon. Once this game is released I'll be transitioning it to FREE.</i><br><br>----------------------<br><br>Tail Drift is a fast action racing game where you zoom through fantastic environments. Compete while flying around floating islands, ancient temples and desert canyons, with a fleet of unique planes to take through a variety of game modes. <br><br>Purchase and upgrade your fleet of planes to gain the edge as you play through 18 unique events.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2 tours featuring 18 unique events to compete in<br></li><li> 7 beautifully hand-crafted tracks to compete on<br></li><li> 3 different event types including Classic Race, Time Trial, and Time Extension<br></li><li> 4 unique planes to purchase and upgrade<br></li><li> Upgrade each plane's speed, handling, acceleration and boost<br></li><li> 3 unique power ups to give you the competitive edge including turbo boost, deadly mines and stun cannons</li></ul>",
